<title>ElimuSmart Learning Hub & Teacher Studio — Version 6</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f3f7ff;color:#10234b;font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:22px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0759d8,#1388f5);color:#fff;border-radius:0 0 22px 22px}
main{max-width:900px;margin:12px auto;padding:0 12px}.panel{background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;margin:12px 0;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #10234b0d}
h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.15rem}.muted{color:#66738a;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5}
.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}button{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 10px;font:inherit;font-weight:750;background:#0759d8;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;width:100%;margin:5px 0}
button small{display:block;font-weight:400;margin-top:4px}button.active{outline:3px solid #a7ffca}.view{display:none}.view.active{display:block}
label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;margin:10px 0 5px}select,textarea{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d8e1f0;border-radius:10px;font:inherit;background:#fff;color:#10234b}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.notice{background:#fff7df;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;color:#72500a;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.5}
iframe{width:100%;height:82vh;min-height:650px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}#teacherOutput{white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.5;overflow-wrap:anywhere;border:1px solid #d8e1f0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;min-height:90px}
@media(min-width:650px){.tiles{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
</style></head><body>
<header><div style="font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:850">📘 Elimu<span style="color:#a7ffca">Smart</span></div><div>Learn • Practise • Excel</div><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Learning and Assessment Hub</h2><p>Self-tests for learners and assessment-planning tools for teachers.</p><div class="notice" style="max-width:1100px;margin:12px auto;">Version 6 improvement: practice tests no longer repeat questions just to fill the selected test length. If the available sample bank is too small, the app tells you how many unique questions are available.</div></header>
<main>
<section class="panel"><h2>Choose a workspace</h2><div class="tiles">
<button class="active" data-view="learner">📝 Learner Examination Centre<small>Practice tests, results and revision advice</small></button>
<button data-view="teacher">👩‍🏫 Teacher Studio<small>Exams, written questions, marking schemes and schemes of work</small></button>
<button data-view="roadmap">🎥 Other Learning Features<small>Videos, experiments and Ask & Answer roadmap</small></button>
</div></section>
<section class="panel view active" id="learner"><h2>Learner Examination Centre</h2><p class="muted">Includes the current prototype question bank. Written-response testing and automatic marking of essays are not yet implemented in this learner module; the teacher tool can draft open-ended questions.</p><iframe title="Learner Examination Centre" srcdoc="&lt;!doctype html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;
&lt;meta name=&quot;theme-color&quot; content=&quot;#0759d8&quot;&gt;
&lt;title&gt;ElimuSmart — Learner Examination Centre&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;style&gt;
:root{--blue:#0759d8;--navy:#10234b;--green:#11985b;--bg:#f3f7ff;--muted:#66738a;--line:#d8e1f0}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--navy)}
header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0759d8,#1388f5);color:white;padding:22px 18px 28px;border-radius:0 0 24px 24px}
.brand{font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:850}.brand span{color:#a7ffca}.tagline{font-size:.92rem;opacity:.95}
main{max-width:820px;margin:-12px auto 28px;padding:0 14px}.panel{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;margin:14px 0;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #10234b0d}
h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 10px}h3{font-size:1rem;margin:14px 0 8px}
label{display:block;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;margin:11px 0 5px}select,input,textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--navy);border-radius:11px;padding:12px;font:inherit}
button{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 12px;font:inherit;font-weight:750;background:var(--blue);color:white;cursor:pointer;margin-top:11px}
button.secondary{background:#eaf1ff;color:var(--blue);border:1px solid #cbdcff}button:disabled{opacity:.55}
.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.tile{background:#f3f7ff;border-radius:14px;padding:13px}.tile strong{display:block}.tile small{color:var(--muted)}
.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5}.pill{display:inline-block;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 10px;background:#e9f1ff;color:var(--blue);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:750}
.notice{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff7df;color:#72500a;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.5}.good{background:#eef8f2;color:#12653d}.question{font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.45;font-weight:750;margin:14px 0}
.option{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;border:1px solid #dce5f4;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;cursor:pointer}.option input{width:auto;margin-top:5px}
.progress{height:8px;background:#e6edf8;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0}.progress div{height:100%;background:var(--green);width:0%;transition:width .2s}
[hidden]{display:none!important}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.stat{padding:12px;background:#f3f7ff;border-radius:12px}.stat strong{font-size:1.2rem;display:block}
footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;padding:12px 18px 28px}
@media(min-width:620px){.tiles{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.row.two{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.row.three{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
&lt;header&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;brand&quot;&gt;📘 Elimu&lt;span&gt;Smart&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tagline&quot;&gt;Learn • Practise • Excel&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:17px 0 0;font-size:1.13rem;font-weight:750&quot;&gt;Learner Examination Centre&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:5px 0 0;opacity:.93&quot;&gt;Prepare, test yourself, understand mistakes, and improve.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;main&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;setup&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🎯 Create your self-test&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;This centre is for learners as well as teachers. Choose your level and build a practice test for yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;row two&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;grade&quot;&gt;Grade / level&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;grade&quot;&gt;
&lt;option&gt;Grade 1&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 2&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 3&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 4&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 5&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 6&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 7&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 8&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 9&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 10&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 11&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Grade 12&lt;/option&gt;
&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;pathwayWrap&quot; hidden&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;pathway&quot;&gt;Senior school pathway&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;pathway&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;STEM&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Social Sciences&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Arts and Sports Science&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;row two&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;subject&quot;&gt;Subject&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;subject&quot;&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;topic&quot;&gt;Topic&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;topic&quot;&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;all&quot;&gt;Mixed topics / whole subject&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;row three&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;mode&quot;&gt;Examination type&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;mode&quot;&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;prepared&quot;&gt;Prepared question bank&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;generated&quot;&gt;Build a new practice set&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;difficulty&quot;&gt;Difficulty&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;difficulty&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;Beginner&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option selected&gt;Intermediate&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Advanced&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;count&quot;&gt;Number of questions&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;count&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;5&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option selected&gt;10&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;15&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;20&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;row two&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;timed&quot;&gt;Time limit&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;timed&quot;&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Untimed practice&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;5 minutes&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;10&quot;&gt;10 minutes&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;20&quot;&gt;20 minutes&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;30&quot;&gt;30 minutes&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;feedbackMode&quot;&gt;Answer explanations&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;feedbackMode&quot;&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;after&quot;&gt;Show after each answer&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;end&quot;&gt;Show after submitting&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;button id=&quot;startBtn&quot;&gt;Start examination&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;notice&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:12px&quot;&gt;Curriculum note: this demo contains a small sample bank, not a complete or officially verified CBE question bank. The “Build a new practice set” option creates variations from local sample templates; it is not connected to an AI service.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🧭 How it works&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tiles&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tile&quot;&gt;📝 &lt;strong&gt;Choose a test&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;small&gt;Grade, subject, topic and difficulty&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tile&quot;&gt;⏱️ &lt;strong&gt;Practise under time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;small&gt;Optional countdown&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tile&quot;&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;Get marked&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;small&gt;Instant marking for multiple choice&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tile&quot;&gt;📊 &lt;strong&gt;Understand results&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;small&gt;Score, answers and explanations&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tile&quot;&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Find weak topics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;small&gt;Get revision recommendations&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tile&quot;&gt;🔁 &lt;strong&gt;Try again&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;small&gt;Practise to measure improvement&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;exam&quot; hidden&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;row two&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pill&quot; id=&quot;examLabel&quot;&gt;Practice test&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;timerText&quot; class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;counter&quot;&gt;Question 1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;scoreLive&quot; class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Answered: 0&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;progress&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;questionText&quot; class=&quot;question&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;options&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;feedback&quot; class=&quot;notice good&quot; hidden&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;button id=&quot;checkBtn&quot;&gt;Check answer&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id=&quot;nextBtn&quot; class=&quot;secondary&quot; hidden&gt;Next question&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;button id=&quot;submitBtn&quot; class=&quot;secondary&quot;&gt;Submit examination&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id=&quot;exitBtn&quot; class=&quot;secondary&quot;&gt;Exit to setup&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;results&quot; hidden&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;📈 Your examination report&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;finalLine&quot; style=&quot;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;row three&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;statCorrect&quot;&gt;0&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Correct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;statWrong&quot;&gt;0&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Incorrect / unanswered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;statPct&quot;&gt;0%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Score&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Review your answers&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;review&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What to revise next&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;advice&quot; class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;button id=&quot;retryBtn&quot;&gt;Create another test&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id=&quot;setupBtn&quot; class=&quot;secondary&quot;&gt;Change grade or subject&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Results are stored only in this browser on this device. They are not an official school assessment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;history&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;📚 Recent practice results&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;historyList&quot; class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Complete a test to see results here.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;button id=&quot;clearHistory&quot; class=&quot;secondary&quot;&gt;Clear local practice history&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;🔐 Accounts and premium features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;A future secure account can sync progress across devices. Premium options could include larger question banks, detailed reports, AI-generated practice tests, and downloadable revision packs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;notice&quot;&gt;Online account creation, cross-device login, live AI generation, and purchases are not connected in this prototype yet. These are not working checkout or login forms. Do not enter real passwords or payment details. We must connect a secure authentication/database service and a verified payment provider before enabling these features.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/main&gt;&lt;footer&gt;ElimuSmart demo • Better learning, brighter future 🇰🇪&lt;/footer&gt;
